    <string name="help_title">How Polka works</string>
    <string name="help_connect_t">Connect</string>
    <string name="help_connect">On the X4 open File Transfer and join Wi-Fi; keep the phone on the same network. Polka finds the reader by itself — if not, tap the drawn reader or long-press it to type the IP shown on the X4 screen.</string>
    <string name="help_books_t">Books</string>
    <string name="help_books">EPUB, FB2, TXT, PDF — anything. Tap «Send books» or use Share → «To X4» in Telegram, a browser or Files. Books queue up and fly as soon as the reader is online.</string>
    <string name="help_shelf_t">Shelf</string>
    <string name="help_shelf">Below the button is what\'s on the card. Tap a folder to open it, «send here» makes it the target, long-press deletes.</string>
    <string name="help_sleep_t">Sleep screens</string>
    <string name="help_sleep">Pick pictures and frame them with your fingers. «Set» shows one picture every time; the rest of /sleep rotates randomly.</string>
    <string name="help_fw_t">Firmware</string>
    <string name="help_fw">Works with CrossPoint and inkMOD. The stock Xteink firmware has no File Transfer API.</string>
